# Local inspection fixtures and generated reports
# A report names the files that were inspected, the hosts they came from, and their digests, so it is
# more identifying than any single hash. Ignoring only the reports/ directory left one saved anywhere
# else in the tree fully committable.
test-fixtures/
test-results/
reports/
pc-black-box-*.md
pc-black-box-*.json
*.report.md
*.report.json
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.etl

